{% section id="device:usage:operations:index" title="运行维护与设备操作" %}

{% directory-order items=["installation.mdoc","devices.mdoc","serial-binding.mdoc","xiaomi.mdoc","backup-restore.mdoc","troubleshooting.mdoc"] /%}

先按[安装、升级与恢复](installation.mdoc)准备程序；日常管理查[实例与设备配置](devices.mdoc)和[串口稳定绑定](serial-binding.mdoc)。迁移或升级前按[备份说明](backup-restore.mdoc)保存完整数据，浏览器打不开时查[端口排错](troubleshooting.mdoc)。

中国大陆米家账号的扫码、设备勾选与结果语义见[接入米家开关](xiaomi.mdoc)。

